表情复杂\n右下格9：远景拉远，苏念独自坐在茶台，渺小身影与广阔群山形成对比\n\n每个面板独立成图，无文字、无字幕、无时间码、无水印。\n\n每个面板独立成图且构图优秀，无任何文字、无字幕、无时间码、无水印、无风格漂移。\n8k超高清，极其精细，masterpiece，cinematic质感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [890.4959106445312, 1431.3131103515625], "pos": [4343.17138671875, 4817.26904296875], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [8], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "image_url", "label": "image_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [878.806640625, 694.3636474609375], "pos": [5571.24169921875, 2160.0283203125], "widgets_values": ["将这张人物照片，超分为4K超清画质，保留的所有细腻纹理、虹彩光泽，色彩还原准确，无噪点、无模糊，边缘锐利，画面干净，最终画幅为16:9。去掉水印", 1179951188, "randomize", "16:9", "2k", false, "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 17, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 18, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "i